<title>ESTONIA: HANSA TO ANNOUNCE NEW PROFIT FORECAST.</title>
<headline>HANSA TO ANNOUNCE NEW PROFIT FORECAST.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hansapank, Estonia's largest commercial bank, will on July 29 announce its new 1997 profit forecast, it said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The board will discuss the forecast today...It will be announced tomorrow,&quot; Mart Toevere, analysis department economist, told Reuters.</p>
<p>Hansapank will release a revised profit forecast at a news conference, due to start at 1100.</p>
<p>Its present group 1997 profit forecast is 320 million kroons.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
